   "result": "+5 V from the USB-C (up to 1.5 A), +7.8 V at 250 mA for the gain blocks (yellow LED), 25 MHz square wave on REF OUT and the REF25 bus",
   "notes": [
    "USB-C power only: 5.1 k on each CC asks any source for 5 V; a 2 A PTC, a 5 V TVS and 20 uF.  The MT3608 boosts to 7.8 V",
    "(0.6 V x 13 from 12 k / 1 k) for the two GALI-84+ tiles (200 mA); the +8V rail is a strip under row 1 that their",
    "headers reach with a via.  The TPS7A2033 makes 3.3 V for the TC32H4 TCXO (+-2 ppm) and the 74LVC1G17 that drives",
    "REF OUT (51 ohm: 1.6 Vpp into 50 ohm) and the REF25 line on the back to the synthesizers' jumpers (3.3 Vpp open).",
    "The TCXO's pad 1 (enable or no connection on the drawing) floats, as CostasLink's review settled."
   ],
